CHAPTER.VERS:
The vision of Obadiah. Thus says the Sovereign Yahweh concerning Edom: We have heard news from Yahweh, and an ambassador is sent among the nations, [saying], Arise

          {+}
        , and let us rise up against her in battle.

Don't enter into the gate of my people in the day of their calamity; yes, don't look on their affliction in the day of their calamity, neither lay

          {+}
         [hands] on their substance in the day of their calamity.

For as you

          {+}
         have drank on my holy mountain, so will all the nations drink continually; yes, they will drink, and swallow down, and will be as though they had not been.
